al fund pools money from many investors and invests it according to a stated objective. A professional fund-management team makes investment decisions within the scheme's mandate."}],["$","p","In return for the money invested, each investor receives units. The value of those units changes with the value of the scheme's underlying investments.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"In return for the money invested, each investor receives units. The value of those units changes with the value of the scheme's underlying investments."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Understanding NAV",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold","children":"Understanding NAV"}],[["$","p","Net Asset Value, or NAV, is the per-unit value of a mutual fund scheme after accounting for its assets and liabilities. NAV is generally declared at the end of each business day.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Net Asset Value, or NAV, is the per-unit value of a mutual fund scheme after accounting for its assets and liabilities. NAV is generally declared at the end of each business day."}],["$","p","A lower NAV does not automatically mean that a scheme is cheaper or has more growth potential. Suitability depends on the scheme's objective, portfolio, risks, costs and your needs.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"A lower NAV does not automatically mean that a scheme is cheaper or has more growth potential. Suitability depends on the scheme's objective, portfolio, risks, costs and your needs."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Common categories",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold","children":"Common categories"}],[["$","p","Mutual funds are grouped by what they invest in and how they are managed.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Mutual funds are grouped by what they invest in and how they are managed."}]],"$L4"]}]